# Mechanism smoke report (Stage 3a/3b)

Generated by `scripts/n1_smoke_report.py` from the raw runs. Gate thresholds are the a-priori ones of spec §16. **Nothing was tuned.**

- Smoke campaign `n1_smoke`: arms A0 and A7 on S1–S8 × D ∈ {10, 20} × 5 runs, plus A0_noshadow on S1–S3 (amendment A-5).
- Calibration campaign: `n1_calib`.

